'''Three Kings''' (3匹の王, ''3 Hiki no Ō'', '''3 Kings''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
Unit Defense UP (Sm): Cats' health increases by 10%.

